From: David J. Vandenburgh <david@vandenburgh.co>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sm8550: add the ADSP FastRPC remote heap

The ADSP's sensors process (a static PD, which serves the gyro and
accelerometer) asks the host for a remote heap when it starts and can't
start without one. Give the ADSP FastRPC node a reserved region for it,
plus the LPASS and ADSP_HEAP VMIDs it gets assigned to.

Since "misc: fastrpc: Allocate entire reserved memory for Audio PD in
probe" the driver hands the whole region to the DSP at probe instead of
carving the heap out on demand, so the region is no-map here. A reusable
(CMA) pool would let the kernel place pages in memory the DSP owns.

qcs8550.dtsi replaces the SM8550 reserved-memory block, so it carries the
heap node too.

Heap size, alignment and VMIDs from justjoseorg's Odin 2 gyro work in
SteamOS-ARM-Port (qcs8550-ayn-odin2-gyro.dtsi), by way of armada.
---
diff --git arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/qcs8550.dtsi arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/qcs8550.dtsi
index f0acdd0..43ecada 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/qcs8550.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/qcs8550.dtsi
@@ -13,6 +13,15 @@
 		#size-cells = <2>;
 		ranges;
 
+		/* Remote heap for the ADSP static (sensors) PD, handed to the DSP at probe */
+		adsp_rpc_remote_heap_mem: adsp-rpc-remote-heap {
+			compatible = "shared-dma-pool";
+			alloc-ranges = <0x0 0x00000000 0x0 0xffffffff>;
+			alignment = <0x0 0x400000>;
+			size = <0x0 0xc00000>;
+			no-map;
+		};
+
 
 		/* These are 3 types of reserved memory regions here:
 		 * 1. Firmware related regions which aren't shared with kernel.
diff --git arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8550.dtsi arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8550.dtsi
index 04dfc8e..0a4b930 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8550.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8550.dtsi
@@ -838,6 +838,15 @@
 		#size-cells = <2>;
 		ranges;
 
+		/* Remote heap for the ADSP static (sensors) PD, handed to the DSP at probe */
+		adsp_rpc_remote_heap_mem: adsp-rpc-remote-heap {
+			compatible = "shared-dma-pool";
+			alloc-ranges = <0x0 0x00000000 0x0 0xffffffff>;
+			alignment = <0x0 0x400000>;
+			size = <0x0 0xc00000>;
+			no-map;
+		};
+
 		hyp_mem: hyp-region@80000000 {
 			reg = <0 0x80000000 0 0xa00000>;
 			no-map;
@@ -3219,6 +3228,9 @@
 					qcom,glink-channels = "fastrpcglink-apps-dsp";
 					label = "adsp";
 					qcom,non-secure-domain;
+					memory-region = <&adsp_rpc_remote_heap_mem>;
+					/* LPASS, ADSP_HEAP */
+					qcom,vmids = <0x16 0x25>;
 					#address-cells = <1>;
 					#size-cells = <0>;
 
